### Execution order summary (happy path → CREATED)
1. `@PreAuthorize` role check (OWNER_ADMIN)
2. `@Valid` bean validation on `OwnerFieldsDto` (NotNull/Pattern/Size/Email)
3. `validateRequiredOwnerFields` (blank guard)
4. map DTO→entity (id & pets ignored)
5. normalize telephone → E.164 (validates)
6. normalize email → lower-case (validates)
7. default registrationDate = today if null
8. reject duplicate telephone (all-owners scan)
9. reject duplicate household unless `sharesHousehold`
10. assign customerCode (`LAST3-NNNN`)
11. `saveOwner` → `@Transactional` → repository `save` (persist) → entity-level `@NotEmpty`/`@Pattern` enforced at flush
12. map to `OwnerDto`, set `Location`, return 201.
